int change_value(int *input) {
    int val;

    val = *input;

    if (val < 100) {
        *input = 100;
    } else {
        *input = val * 2;
    }

    return val;
}
```

In main, `x = 30;` and then `y = change_value(&x);`. What is the value of x after the call?

